BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mosaic Halloween Spooktacular
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261031T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261031T190000
DTSTAMP:20261125T032808Z
UID:6816@mosaic-district
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mosaicdistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/si
 tes/12/2026/02/StrawberryVillageSpooktacular102520250-15-e1771433315843.pn
 g
DESCRIPTION:Grab your costume and join us October 31 for a Spooktacular Ha
 lloween at Mosaic!\n\nStarting at 4 PM\, stop by your favorite shops for t
 rick-or-treating and then lay out your blankets\, spread out your candy\, 
 and enjoy Hocus Pocus on the big screen in Strawberry Park at 6 PM.\n\nWhe
 re can I stop in to Trick-or-Treat?\n\nAngelika\n\nBarnes & Noble\n\nBarta
 co\n\nBedHead PJs\n\nBoll & Branch\n\nBrilliant Earth\n\nB Side\n\nCaboose
  Commons\n\nF45\n\nFaherty\n\nHi/Fi Tex-Mex BBQ\n\nJINYA Ramen Bar\n\nMacm
 illan Whisky Room\n\nMakers Union\n\nNeuhaus\n\nOneLife\n\nPaper Source\n
 \nPupatella\n\nPura Vida\n\nRASA\n\nSouth Moon Under\n\nScout & Molly’s
 \n\nThe Beaufort Bonnet Company\n\nThe Shade Store\n\nTrue Food Kitchen\n
 \nUrbano\n\nWaxing The City\n\nWarby Parker\n\nWest Elm\n\nStay tuned for 
 more!\n\nDetails: https://mosaicdistrict.com/event/mosaic-halloween-spookt
 acular/
LOCATION:Mosaic District\, 2905 District Ave\, Fairfax\, VA 22031
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://mosaicdistrict.com/event/mosaic-halloween-spooktacular/
END:VEVENT
