DESCRIPTION:Join Williams Sonoma for a special event with chef and social 
 media creator Tini Younger (@tinekeyounger) as she celebrates her debut co
 okbook\, Today We Are Cooking!\n\nTini will demonstrate her viral mac and 
 cheese while sharing the techniques and tips that make home cooking simple
 \, fun\, and foolproof. With more than 100 approachable recipes and pro ti
 ps for building confidence in the kitchen\, Today We Are Cooking is packed
  with elevated comfort food you’ll make again and again.\n\nSign up here
 !\n\nDetails: https://mosaicdistrict.com/event/williams-sonoma-today-we-ar
 e-cooking-with-tini-younger/
LOCATION:Williams Sonoma\, 2920 District Ave\, Unit 115\, Fairfax\, VA
